===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|caudex||tree trunk”, “tree stem|lang=la}}; compare {{term|codex|lang=en}}.<ref name="OED">“[http://dictionary.oed.com/cgi/entry/50034790 ‖caudex]” listed in the '''Oxford English Dictionary''' [2<sup>nd</sup> Ed.; 1989]</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{enPR|kôʹdĕks}}, {{IPA|/ˈkɔːdɛks/|lang=en}},<ref name="OED"/>

===Noun===
{{en-noun|caudices}}<ref name="OED"/>

# {{context|botany|lang=en}}<ref name="OED"/> An enlargement of the [[stem]], [[branch]] or [[root]] of a [[woody plant]], usually serving to [[store]] water.

